  "description": "The planning application relates specifically to the following works:\n• An increase in the height of the existing single-storey rear extension, incorporating a new felt flat roof. The revised roof level will remain approximately 500mm below the underside of the existing first-floor window cill.\n• Removal of the existing external plant equipment.\n• Installation of new air-conditioning plant at the rear of the property, together with the associated ventilation provision.\n• Alterations to the front shopfront and façade, including new glazing, operable window panels, window manifestation and a black-painted timber entrance door, new signage.\n• Associated alterations to the rear elevation.",
